# Concurrent-job caps per node for the carbon auto-submitters. SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH.
# Edit a value and the RUNNING submitter picks it up within one poll cycle — NO restart needed.
# Integers only; values above the node's GPU count are clamped (laniakea 8, voyager 4).
# 2026-06-26: dialed carbon OFF laniakea/voyager so the NTv3 trials get those nodes; carbon keeps
# galaxy (NTv3 can't easily run there — node-local SSD paths). Grid is ~90% done, still finishes.
LAN_CAP=2
VOY_CAP=0
GAL_CAP=4
